{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-post-js","path":"/posts/2019-11-20-remove-files-folders-from-remote-repo/","result":{"data":{"markdownRemark":{"html":"<p>If you want to remove a folder from your <code>git</code> repository then simply run these commands into your terminal.\n<br></p>\n<h3 id=\"run\">Run</h3>\n<div class=fakeMenu>\n  <div class=\"fakeButtons fakeClose\"></div>\n  <div class=\"fakeButtons fakeMinimize\"></div>\n  <div class=\"fakeButtons fakeZoom\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"bash\"><pre class=\"language-bash\"><code class=\"language-bash\">$ <span class=\"token function\">rm</span> <span class=\"token parameter variable\">-rf</span> folder_name\n$ <span class=\"token function\">git</span> <span class=\"token function\">add</span> <span class=\"token parameter variable\">--all</span>\n$ <span class=\"token function\">git</span> commit <span class=\"token parameter variable\">-m</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"Your commit message\"</span>\n$ <span class=\"token function\">git</span> push origin <span class=\"token string\">\"branch_name\"</span></code></pre></div>\n<p>These commands will remove that folder from your <code>git</code> repository of that branch.</p>","rawMarkdownBody":"\nIf you want to remove a folder from your `git` repository then simply run these commands into your terminal.\n<br>\n\n### Run\n\n<div class=fakeMenu>\n  <div class=\"fakeButtons fakeClose\"></div>\n  <div class=\"fakeButtons fakeMinimize\"></div>\n  <div class=\"fakeButtons fakeZoom\"></div>\n</div>\n\n```bash\n$ rm -rf folder_name\n$ git add --all\n$ git commit -m \"Your commit message\"\n$ git push origin \"branch_name\"\n```\n\nThese commands will remove that folder from your `git` repository of that branch.\n","tableOfContents":"<ul>\n<li><a href=\"#run\">Run</a></li>\n</ul>","timeToRead":1,"excerpt":"If you want to remove a folder from your git repository then simply run these commands into your terminal.\n Ru